WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.200
Jambo kila mtu! Je, unatazama
kaptura wima kwenye simu yako?

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.800
Je, unaweza kubadilisha kati
ya manukuu ya Kipolandi na
Kiingereza kwa kugonga mara moja?

3
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:13.500
<i>Kila mstari husalia chini ya herufi
42 ili maandishi yasizidi kufurika!</i>

4
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:17.600
Gusa <b>Polski (CC)</b> chini ya
kichezaji ili uijaribu sasa hivi.
